---
/* Homepage "Help guides" section: how-to guides plus the keyboard shortcut table. */
---
<section class="hpSec" id="hpGuides">
  <h2>Help guides</h2>
  <div class="hpGuide">
    <h3>How to draw</h3>
    <p>Pick a tool from the left toolbar, choose a color, then draw on the canvas. Shapes, text, stickers and outlines stay selected after you place them — drag to move, use the handles to resize or rotate, then tap anywhere else to finish.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hpGuide">
    <h3>How to draw with friends</h3>
    <p>Tap the people button, then <b>Create room</b>. Share the 5-letter code (and password, if you set one). Friends tap the same button, enter the code and join. In <b>Creator mode</b> everyone gets their own canvas; in <b>Open mode</b> everyone draws together on one shared canvas.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hpGuide">
    <h3>Keyboard shortcuts</h3>
    <table class="hpKeys">
      <tr><td><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>/<kbd>⌘</kbd> + <kbd>Z</kbd></td><td>Undo</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>/<kbd>⌘</kbd> + <kbd>Y</kbd> <span class="hpOr">or</span> <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>/<kbd>⌘</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Z</kbd></td><td>Redo</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>P</kbd></td><td>Pencil</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>B</kbd></td><td>Brush</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>H</kbd></td><td>Highlighter</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>E</kbd></td><td>Eraser</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>G</kbd></td><td>Paint bucket fill</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>L</kbd></td><td>Line tool</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>A</kbd></td><td>Arrow tool</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>O</kbd></td><td>Shapes</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>T</kbd></td><td>Text tool</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>S</kbd></td><td>Select tool</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>M</kbd></td><td>Move / pan the canvas</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>Delete</kbd> <span class="hpOr">or</span> <kbd>Backspace</kbd></td><td>Delete the selected drawing</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>Esc</kbd></td><td>Cancel what you're placing / deselect</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>
